# Project boundaries

- Do not install or implement Sanity, Supabase, Stripe, or membership flows unless the current task explicitly asks for that phase.
- Relume: packages and `components/relume/` are allowed as a **component source**. Promote sections into OCA-named components before shipping; do not leave Relume section numbers as the public API.
- Do not create empty folders (`lib/sanity`, `lib/supabase`, `lib/stripe`, etc.) until they have real files.
- Prefer boring, understandable architecture over speculative abstractions.
- After significant changes, run `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run build`.
- Stop at the end of the requested phase; do not auto-continue into the next roadmap phase.
